        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Ababenyamini babigenza kuno, binyagira abageni mu baje kuvyina bahwanye n’igitigiri cabo, barabashorera; baraheza barīgīra, basubira mw ishamvu yabo, bongera kwubaka ibisagara, babibamwo. ",
